%%{init: {"sequence": {"mirrorActors": false, "messageMargin": 16, "actorMargin": 12, "boxMargin": 6, "noteMargin": 6, "width": 80}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    actor U as Bibliophile
    participant VM as LibraryAppModel
    participant C as LibraryController
    participant S as MoveBookToShelf<br/>UseCase
    participant B as Book
    participant R as BookRepository
    U->>VM: "To Owned"
    VM-->>U: "Purchased<br/>or gifted?"
    U->>VM: chooseGifted(),<br/>giver's name
    VM->>C: move(isbn, OWNED,<br/>status, Gift)
    C->>S: execute(ownerId,<br/>isbn, OWNED, gift)
    S->>R: loadLibrary(ownerId)
    R-->>S: PersonalLibrary
    S->>B: acquire(gift)
    S->>B: moveTo(OWNED)
    Note over B: Owned needs<br/>a complete<br/>Purchase or Gift
    alt acquisition missing or incomplete
        B-->>S: NotAcquired /<br/>GiftSourceRequired<br/>error
        S-->>VM: error, nothing saved
        VM-->>U: explains what's missing
    else rule satisfied
        S->>R: save(ownerId, book)
        R-->>S: Book
        S-->>C: Book
        C->>C: setReading(isbn, status)
        C-->>VM: Book
        VM-->>U: "Moved to Owned"
    end
